          <Pad Id="PGXstPTbtNeRmLhMGj0PyJ" Bounds="890,860,560,60" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="the tile arrives as bytes (HTTPGet, held by HoldLatest, Body out of Split), becomes an image&#xD;&#xA;(ImageDecoder), and Pipet reads ONE pixel out of it - the one under your cursor. Four nodes&#xD;&#xA;that already existed. Nothing here was written for elevation; the data just arrived in a&#xD;&#xA;shape these nodes already understood.">
